          "body": "The gradient of \\(AC\\) is \\(-\\frac67\\).\n\n\\[\n\\frac{q-10}{8-p}=-\\frac67\n\\]\n\n\\[\n7(q-10)=-6(8-p)\n\\]\n\n\\[\n7q-70=-48+6p\n\\]\n\n\\[\n6p-7q=-22\n\\]"
