          "body": "Since \\(\\angle ABC=90^\\circ\\), lines \\(AB\\) and \\(BC\\) are perpendicular.\n\n\\[\n\\text{gradient of }AB=\\frac{10-(-5)}{p-(-1)}=\\frac{15}{p+1}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\text{gradient of }BC=\\frac{q-(-5)}{8-(-1)}=\\frac{q+5}{9}\n\\]"
