          "body": "The product of perpendicular gradients is \\(-1\\):\n\n\\[\n\\frac{15}{p+1}\\times \\frac{q+5}{9}=-1\n\\]\n\n\\[\n15(q+5)=-9(p+1)\n\\]\n\n\\[\n5(q+5)=-3(p+1)\n\\]\n\n\\[\n3p+5q=-28\n\\]"
        },
